          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "東の空が白みはじめ、新しい朝の訪れを告げていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "窓から眺めると、東の方角に遠く富士山の輪郭が見える。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "商船団は東へ向けて錨を上げ、外洋へ出航していった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "wagon",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "農作物を運ぶための東が二台、牛に引かせて村道を行く。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "その古ぼけた東は轍の深い道を、きしみ音を立てながら進んでいた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "納屋の隅に放置された朽ちかけた東が、かつての栄光をしのばせていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "gloss": "my spouse",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "わが東よ、この先も人生の喜びも苦しみも一緒に歩もう。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "東は毎朝早く起きて、黙々と家の仕事をこなしていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "我が東の細やかな心遣いにいつも感謝している。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
